{"schema_version":1,"id":"d59f2nky2qrn","type":"work","title":"方氏墨譜","authors":[{"name":"方于魯","role":"撰","dynasty":"明","entity_id":"hixhd2h9bexe"}],"indexed_by":[{"source":"欽定四庫全書總目","source_bid":"d59dh3vo9af4","title_info":"《方氏墨譜》•六卷","author_info":"明方于魯撰","summary":"明方于魯撰。于魯初名大激，後以字行，改字建元，歙縣人。初亦頗學為詩，汪道昆與之聯姻，招入豐幹社，獎飾甚至。後得程君房墨法，乃改而制墨，與君房相軋，彎弓射羿，世兩譏焉。此編乃所作《墨譜》。首列同時諸人投贈之作，下分國寶、國華、博古、博物、法寶、鴻寶六類。上自符璽圭璧，下至雜佩，凡三百八十五式，摹繪精細，各系題贊，亦備列真草隸篆之文，頗為工巧。然其意主於炫耀以求名，故所繪僅墨之形制，與程氏爭勝於刻鏤間耳，於墨法未嘗一講也。","edition":"浙江汪啟淑家藏本"},{"source":"續修四庫全書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vksh","title_info":"《方氏墨譜》六卷","author_info":"明方于魯撰","summary":"《方氏墨譜》六卷。明方于魯撰。影印明萬曆方氏美蔭堂刻本。","edition":"影印明萬曆方氏美蔭堂刻本","volume":"第1114冊","section":"子部 譜録類"},{"source":"四庫全書存目叢書","source_bid":"d59f2og4vke9","title_info":"《方氏墨譜》六卷","author_info":"明方于魯撰","summary":"《方氏墨譜》六卷。明方于魯撰。私藏明萬曆方氏美蔭堂刻本。","edition":"私藏明萬曆方氏美蔭堂刻本","volume":"第79冊","section":"子部"}],"juan_count":{"number":6},"resources":[{"id":"shidianguji-wanlifangshimeiyinta","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/HY1624","metadata":{"edition":"萬曆方氏美蔭堂刻本","version":"v9","total_page":484,"paragraph_count":19,"check_type":"粗校"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-wanlifangshimeiyinta-1","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02095369","metadata":{"edition":"萬曆方氏美蔭堂刻本","version":"v4","total_page":552,"paragraph_count":1837,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"id":"shidianguji-keben","name":"识典古籍","url":"https://www.shidianguji.com/book/CADAL02055880","metadata":{"edition":"刻本","version":"v3","total_page":1180,"paragraph_count":3034,"check_type":"AI整理"},"types":["text","image"]},{"name":"Internet Archive","id":"internet-archive","url":"https://archive.org/details/02095369.cn","types":["image"]},{"id":"wikimedia-commons-xuxiu","name":"維基共享 續修四庫全書 PDF","short_name":"維基共享","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BA%8C%E4%BF%AE%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E7%AC%AC1114%E5%86%8A.pdf","metadata":{"volume":1114},"types"